{"id":"word:hebrew:H6486","type":"word","title":"פְּקֻדָּה","subtitle":"H6486 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"visitation (in many senses, chiefly official)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to פְּקֻדָּה (H6486) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 32 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"פְּקֻדָּה (pᵉquddâh) means visitation (in many senses, chiefly official) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 23 11."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"פְּקֻדָּה","transliteration":"pᵉquddâh","pronunciation":"pek-ood-daw'","strong":"H6486","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6486","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["פְּקֻדָּתָ֖/ם","פְּקֻדָּתָֽ/ם","פְּקֻדַּ֣ת","לִ/פְקֻדָּ֖ה","לִ/פְקֻדָּתָ֖/ם"],"morphs":[["HNcfsc/Sp3mp",11],["HNcfsc",4],["HC/Ncfsc",3],["HNcfpc",2],["HNcfpa",2],["HR/Ncfsa",1],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3mp",1],["HTd/Ncfsa",1],["HNcfsa",1],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp3mp",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"visitation (in many senses, chiefly official)","usage":"account, (that have the) charge, custody, that which...laid up, numbers, office(-r), ordering, oversight, prison, reckoning, visitation.","full":"H6486. pequddah מְּקֻדָּה 32 noun feminine oversight, mustering, visitation, store ; — absolute ׳פ Hosea 9:7 ; 1Chr 23:11 ; construct מְּקֻדַּת Num 3:32 +; suffix מְּקֻדָּתוֺ Num 109:8, etc.; plural מְּקֻדּ(וֺ)ת Jer 52:11 +; — 1 visitation: a. = punishment Hosea 9:7 ; Isa 10:3 ; Micah 7:4 ; Ezek 9:1 ; Num 16:29 (P), especially in מְּקֻדָּתָם עֵת(שְׁנַתׅ Jer 8:12 ; 10:15 6 t. Jeremiah (compare עֵת with מָּקַד 6:15 ; 49:8 ; 50:31 ), הַמּ ׳בֵּית = prison 52:11 . b. gracious visitation, providence Job 10:12 . 2. a. oversight, charge Num 4:16 (P), also 3:36 (P; redund.), 1Chr 26:30 ; = office 2Chr 23:18 . b. overseer (abstract for concrete), 2Kin 11:8 ; Ezek 44:11 (with אֶל of thing), Num 3:32 (P); collective = magistracy Isa 60:17 (Lag BN 151 ), compare 2Chr 24:11 . c. class of officers 1Chr 23:11 ; 24:3 , 19 . d. charge = thing entrusted Num 4:16 (P). 3 mustering 2Chr 17:14 ; 26:11 . 4 store , things laid up, Isa 15:7 ; Psa 109:8 (perhaps; Hup We Skizzen vi. 184 and others office ).","rootNote":"feminine passive participle of 6485 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 23 11","keyReferences":["1Chr 23 11","1Chr 24 3","1Chr 24 19","1Chr 26 30","2Chr 17 14","2Chr 23 18","2Chr 24 11","2Chr 26 11"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":32,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 23 11","book":"1Chr","chapter":23,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/פְקֻדָּ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 24 3","book":"1Chr","chapter":24,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/פְקֻדָּתָ֖/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 24 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":24,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פְקֻדָּתָ֞/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 26 30","book":"1Chr","chapter":26,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פְּקֻדַּ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"2Chr 17 14","book":"2Chr","chapter":17,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פְקֻדָּתָ֖/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 23 18","book":"2Chr","chapter":23,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פְּקֻדֹּ֜ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpc"},{"reference":"2Chr 24 11","book":"2Chr","chapter":24,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פְּקֻדַּ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"2Chr 26 11","book":"2Chr","chapter":26,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פְּקֻדָּתָ֔/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"2Kgs 11 18","book":"2Kgs","chapter":11,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פְּקֻדּ֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpa"},{"reference":"Ezek 9 1","book":"Ezek","chapter":9,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWo